15.png", "id": "593120590297334", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391812_593120596964000_4093537767800586160_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wh-QHR_wWXAQ7kNvwFoo4ih&_nc_oc=Adqmh9ClaN2WU6yUsM2-1TGk8FooiCQh4x9OmIPaTANywY81s8OcM5itimMno8ZTQmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAHywiHe8BmCU8jwdiyOhp1TgxdX7VuEBiavSYFL78fGw&oe=6A5F5DEC"}, {"file_name": "image_005_0000.png", "id": "1020699260107858", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391837_1020699263441191_2298371123509554043_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zhjDWqsRn7QQ7kNvwFbMibL&_nc_oc=AdqTwhrp1dtefVUIGKTMf7wXt7nYNzjzMhEeLlv_VGpAQSAR0GCtt34bmtsT-Q0gGJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBByytsV1w9tgCvJamG4zpiFB-pqcxr15T4RKtDE3lAaQ&oe=6A5F5B74"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Enter Emotions", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Enter Emotions is a VR application that builds emotional intelligence through short, immersive experiences. It helps users recognize, understand and regulate emotions in safe scenarios\u2014solo or with a specialist. Designed for clarity, it guides you step by step: from calming down, through insight, to practicing attention and timely responses.\n\nApp modules:\ufffd\n\n\u2022 Animations \u2014 brief scenes explaining how emotions work and how they shape thoughts and behavior; observe social situations, identify characters\u2019 feelings, and learn adequate responses.\ufffd\n\n\u2022 Relaxation scene \u2014 a quiet space for breathing and tension reduction; it builds readiness for learning and eases stress before further training.\ufffd\n\n\u2022 Mindfulness / focus / reaction-speed training \u2014 drills that strengthen attention, alertness, and control of focus in dynamic conditions.\ufffd\n\n\u2022 Game \u2014 an observation task: memorize details of the environment and answer questions (e.g., how many ducks are on the pond?). Higher levels increase the number of moving and sound stimuli, supporting transfer to everyday life.\n\nEnter Emotions combines narrative, relaxation, and cognitive training to support conscious responses in relationships and tasks. Useful in education, social-skills training and individual work. Optimized for onboarding and repeatable practice.\n\nThis material is published under the CC BY 4.0 license (Creative Commons \u2013 Attribution \u2013 4.0 International). \n\nThe application was created within the \u201cPOPOJUTRZE 3.0\u201d project.", "short_description": "The Enter Emotions app is an innovative tool that supports learning to recognize and name emotions through virtual reality. It creates an immersive environment that helps users experience and understand emotions in a controlled, safe way. The app includes animations for analyzing emotions, relaxation exercises and mindfulness training to help develop memory, concentration, attentiveness and self-awareness."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "PDP-PROMO-3000900.png", "id": "4080289242206870", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391784_4080289245540203_1637910289234212728_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GiiurI2xawUQ7kNvwFTsubD&_nc_oc=AdrTjNAcRMhOwgzTVqzH6ftlxUVO-hRKeP5a6-NFoIJly9oTsRyPFXP1ptCwboqwQlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAysK53ztm6P1xtXwy51MMYdRX3Ca4ROps68ao48SgOFg&oe=6A5F7719"}, {"file_name": "LOGO-IKONA-TRANS.png", "id": "4051608655084468", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_4051608658417801_4081838733268112048_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=njJKcP0B2s4Q7kNvwH6GJBp&_nc_oc=AdrdZQd9SlFQ78ku2F5tznzLGPaMlT4JHEDv8Lnw9BsAUiVlaYL00GU7G942mkRejAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDSqBFEjSilMsmdIBC9RD86VN3sERIfmxwPfrJmbfKZ6Q&oe=6A5F6